  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Vanquish is an arm-friendly multifilament string built around a DuPont high-modulus polyamide multifilament core and enhanced performance resin. It is designed to provide an excellent combination of touch, directional control, comfort and shock absorption while keeping power at a manageable level. Vanquish can be used as a comfortable full-bed string or as the softer component in a hybrid setup, including Solinco's official Tour Bite + Vanquish configuration.",

    "zh": "Solinco Vanquish 是一款以护臂、触球感和控制为核心的高性能多芯球线，采用 DuPont 高模量聚酰胺多芯核心，并结合 Enhanced Performance Resin 增强树脂。它能够提供优秀的触球反馈、方向控制、舒适性和减震表现，同时保持可控的力量输出。Vanquish 既可以整床使用，也非常适合作为 Hybrid 混穿中的柔和线材，例如 Solinco 官方的 Tour Bite + Vanquish 组合。"
  },

